WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:26.170
I summon Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:01:33.110 --> 00:01:35.900
Here I go!  It's my Battle Phase!

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.020
Rocket Warrior transforms into Invincible Mode!

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:41.270
Attack Red-Eyes!

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.100
It hurts!

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.300
What's this pain?

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.070
Jonouchi...

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:06.240
I want you to hold on to the Millennium Puzzle...

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.000
...in my place.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:17.280
Countdown to Despair

00:02:33.550 --> 00:02:36.930
We'll reach the time limit in 20 minutes.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:41.670
If there's no winner, we'll both sink into the ocean.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:45.400
But I won't give up until the end.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:52.550
If Jonouchi can regain his senses within the time limit, I'm sure there's a way to escape.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:03:00.130
Red-Eyes, if you still have the strength, fight with me to the end!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:09.280
Jonouchi, take off that disgusting Millennium Item!

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:13.300
Destroy the Millennium Puzzle that contains the Pharaoh's soul!

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:21.810
The vessel Yugi gave us the Millennium Puzzle, admitting that he lost.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.750
I won?

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.420
Yes.  We won!

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:38.200
The Pharaoh hid inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:42.540
I wanted to torture him more, but it's fine.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:44.540
If he won't come out, then destroy it!

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:49.460
Jonouchi...

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:56.840
Yes!  Throw the parts into the sea so that no one can complete the Puzzle again!

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:58.880
See ya!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.770
Your treasure?

00:04:10.300 --> 00:04:13.100
This is your chance for payback.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.100
Punch them!

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:19.040
Stop it!  I won't hit my friends!

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.800
Dammit!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:58.010
Why won't you obey me?

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.820
I'm a duelist...

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:04.170
Jonouchi...

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.320
I don't care about a 3000 year-old grudge.

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:10.750
I'll settle this in a duel!

00:05:10.980 --> 00:05:13.490
Jonouchi, how dare you!

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.160
Yugi!  It's your turn!

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:17.820
Jonouchi...

00:05:18.740 --> 00:05:21.530
Marik's brainwashing is weakening.

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:23.970
14 minutes left.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.660
I will also fight as a duelist.

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:31.660
Jonouchi, I won't give up until you're back to normal!

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:33.310
My turn!

00:05:33.630 --> 00:05:39.320
Rocket Warrior's effect is over, so Red-Eyes regains 500 attack points.

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:42.340
I draw a card!

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:48.650
Jonouchi has Rocket Warrior in attack position.

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:52.800
It will transform into Invincible Mode during Jonouchi's Battle Phase.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.580
Magnet Warrior has 1700 attack points.

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:00.300
It can destroy Rocket Warrior before it transforms.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:05.080
But that won't turn Jonouchi back to normal.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.760
There's only one card that can touch Jonouchi's heart.

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.480
Only Red-Eyes!

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:13.310
I set two cards!

00:06:13.310 --> 00:06:17.560
And I summon Beta The Magnet Warrior in attack position!

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.360
I end my turn!

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:22.000
My turn!

00:06:22.430 --> 00:06:24.400
He made a mistake.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:27.950
He kept that weak Red-Eyes in attack position.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:30.000
Finish Yugi this turn!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.300
I draw!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:38.270
If Panther Warrior destroys Red-Eyes, you win!

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.370
I win...

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:43.310
Yes.  You'll win against Yugi.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.750
Win against Yugi...

00:06:48.370 --> 00:06:53.120
This is bad.  Marik's brainwashing was weakening, but it's getting stronger again.

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.510
Kill him.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.130
Kill him.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:57.460
Kill him!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.150
I summon Panther Warrior!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:07.500
Rocket Warrior transforms into Invincible Mode!

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:17.400
That weak Red-Eyes only has 900 attack points.

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:22.110
But Panther Warrior has 2000 attack points.

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.680
The difference is 1100.

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:31.450
The vessel Yugi only has 1000 life points.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.560
This attack will kill him.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:41.170
Jonouchi, attack Red-Eyes with Panther Warrior!

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:43.340
Attack, Rocket Warrior!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:44.270
What?

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:48.580
Rocket Warrior attacks Beta The Magnet Warrior!

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.750
Rocket Warrior attacks Beta The Magnet Warrior?

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:57.720
Jonouchi!  Why won't you attack Red-Eyes with Panther Warrior?

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:02.700
I activate a trap card!

00:08:02.700 --> 00:08:04.260
Magic-Arm Shield!

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.940
I caught the invincible Rocket Warrior!

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:17.660
Attack Panther Warrior!

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:23.910
Due to the Continuous Spell Attrition's effect...

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:28.940
...Panther Warrior loses 1500 attack points, which is equal to the damage it took.

00:08:31.540 --> 00:08:37.880
And due to Rocket Warrior's effect, it loses 500 attack points until the end of the turn.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:44.800
Jonouchi, I'll keep fighting until you're back to yourself.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:48.280
I now understand, Jonouchi.

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:51.040
You refuse to obey me.

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:53.050
I must teach you a lesson.

00:08:54.870 --> 00:08:58.870
I hate people who don't obey me.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.850
Jonouchi, after you drown Yugi in the ocean, you're next!

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.050
You and the Millennium Puzzle will drown together!

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:19.420
I'm sure Jonouchi is heading to the location of the finals.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:23.170
As long as the Ghouls haven't captured him.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.410
Big brother...

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.740
Idiot!  Don't say that around Shizuka!

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.480
We don't know if he's captured!

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:35.020
Sure...  Anyway, let's go to the finals.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.600
But we don't know the location.

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:42.020
We have to find someone who has six Puzzle Cards.

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:44.590
Over there!

00:09:45.260 --> 00:09:47.400
Hey!  Can I ask you something?

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:52.560
My turn.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:58.640
Rocket Warrior's effect ends, so Panther Warrior regains 500 attack points.

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:02.680
I draw a card!

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.480
I tribute Beta The Magnet Warrior!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.950
I summon Archfiend of Gilfer!

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:16.310
Attack Rocket Warrior!

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.160
Gilfer Flame!

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.430
Rocket Warrior explodes!

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.540
Jonouchi...

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:32.320
It's not over, Yugi!

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.540
That's not enough to drop my life points to 0!

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:41.480
Like I thought, Gilfer's attack is unable to touch his heart.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:50.260
Red-Eyes is the only one who can awaken Jonouchi's soul, but it's so damaged that it can't stand up.

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:59.600
What should I do?

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:06.910
You only have one Puzzle Card?

00:11:07.460 --> 00:11:10.600
Sheesh!  What have you been doing?

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:11.950
How'd you do?

00:11:13.880 --> 00:11:18.820
We didn't find any duelists who've qualified for the finals...

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:20.660
Hey...

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:27.060
Jonouchi, did the Ghouls really capture you?

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:32.700
Oh no!  They found us!

00:11:32.700 --> 00:11:33.600
Run!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:35.800
Wait!

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.050
C'mon!  They'll capture us!

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:41.500
Otogi, take Shizuka and run!

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.250
What about you?

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.850
I'll deal with them.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:44.760
Honda!

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.150
Run away!

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.340
Okay!

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.150
Shizuka!  This way!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.680
Don't lose them!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.880
Stop right there!

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.060
You're not going any further.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.870
Hey!  Watch out!

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:06.680
I'm sorry.

00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:09.040
Some weirdos are chasing us!

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:49.160
How can I get Jonouchi back to normal?

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.330
Where's Jonouchi?

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:03.800
You know, right?  Tell me!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:05.090
Domino Pier.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.570
Domino Pier?

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:12.600
Honda!  We're here to pick you up!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.140
Mai?

00:13:13.430 --> 00:13:15.060
Shizuka!  Otogi!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:18.070
So you know each other.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.160
I heard what's up.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.230
The Ghouls are chasing you?

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.680
You know the Ghouls?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:32.850
I keep an ear out everywhere, so I hear things.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:35.220
Especially about those who irritate me.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.030
About Jonouchi...

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:38.730
Here!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:42.660
I know where the finals will take place!

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:46.510
No, not that!  Jonouchi is at Domino Pier!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:48.800
Domino Pier?

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.150
Yeah.  The Ghoul told me.

00:13:51.150 --> 00:13:52.240
Hurry!

00:13:52.240 --> 00:13:53.480
OK!

00:13:57.830 --> 00:13:59.680
Hang on!

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:14.110
My turn.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:18.350
Skull Dice...

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:21.310
Time is running out.

00:14:22.150 --> 00:14:27.910
If Jonouchi wastes time by doing nothing this turn, they'll both die.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.440
That'll be fun.

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:38.260
In 8 minutes, my family's 3000 year-old revenge will come to an end.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:45.800
Due to your broken friendship that will never be repaired for eternity!

00:14:55.840 --> 00:15:00.300
You're done.  You don't need to think about your next move.

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.780
You don't have to duel.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:06.050
Don't do anything and let time pass by.

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:16.890
Jonouchi, do you remember Duelist Kingdom?

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:23.880
You fought hard to save Shizuka.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:26.560
As a duelist.

00:15:26.960 --> 00:15:28.900
And you won the prize money.

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:33.060
Shizuka...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.620
Stay strong, Shizuka!

00:15:44.350 --> 00:15:48.590
And the promise we made during Battle City.

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:58.500
Yugi, when I keep winning and become a true duelist, I want you to duel me again.

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:09.260
I set two cards.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:15.980
And I end my turn while leaving Panther Warrior in attack position.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:23.430
So you'll keep defying me and continue the duel, Jonouchi.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:28.290
But he hasn't broken my mind control yet.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:29.970
Is he...

00:16:30.570 --> 00:16:33.450
Is he fighting by instinct?

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.280
My turn!

00:16:36.460 --> 00:16:38.050
That's right, Jonouchi.

00:16:38.540 --> 00:16:40.670
We have to duel!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:43.970
You can return to normal thru dueling!

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:45.610
That's what I believe!

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:49.280
I have to hurry.  There's little time left.

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:50.900
I draw a card!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:53.900
Bring it, Yugi!

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.040
I set one card!

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:01.100
Archfiend of Gilfer attacks Panther Warrior!

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.080
I tricked you, Yugi!

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:15.560
I left Panther Warrior in attack position with only 500 attack points to lure you to attack!

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:16.540
I know.

00:17:17.380 --> 00:17:18.930
Gilfer Flame!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:25.140
I flip over my spell cards!

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:27.900
I'll turn the tables with these!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.880
Graceful Dice and Skull Dice!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:32.630
It's a double set combo!

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:39.730
Graceful Dice multiplies Panther Warrior's attack points depending on what I roll.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:44.840
Skull Dice will reduce Archfiend of Gilfer's attack points!

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.820
This will destroy your monster!

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:49.090
I won't let you!

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:49.720
What?

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:53.230
I activate my set card De-Spell!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.450
This card negates Graceful Dice!

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.550
Panther Warrior won't gain attack points.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:07.930
So it'll depend on the amount of attack points Skull Dice will reduce.

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:12.770
Two?

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:18.570
Damn!  I failed!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.650
We're at the pier!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:31.950
Jonouchi is around here, right?

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:35.720
Big brother...

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:38.940
Don't worry.

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:41.160
Your brother is a good guy.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:45.170
Make sure to watch him in the finals with your own eyes.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:46.600
Yes!

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:50.050
Hey!  Over there!

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:51.280
What's going on?

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:59.370
Jonouchi and my life points are about equal.

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:04.680
If our life points become 0 at the same time...

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:08.600
We may both be able to escape.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:15.280
Yugi only has 1000 life points.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:20.680
And the countdown to death is ticking away.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:28.410
Jonouchi!

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:29.340
Yugi!

00:19:30.980 --> 00:19:32.110
Shizuka!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:34.820
Anzu?

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.220
What happened?

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:38.520
Don't go there, Honda!

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:40.640
Why, Mokuba?

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:41.520
Look.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.320
Damn!  What's that?

00:19:52.320 --> 00:19:54.720
They took Anzu hostage.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:55.900
What for?

00:19:56.300 --> 00:20:00.810
So we can't interfere with Yugi and Jonouchi's duel.

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:11.560
Why are Yugi and Jonouchi dueling?

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.940
And what's with those chains tied to the anchor?

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.490
It's a death duel.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:20.200
Death duel?

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:27.310
The Ghouls brainwashed Jonouchi, so Yugi is risking his life to get him back to normal.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:28.230
What?

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:29.430
Jonouchi?

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:30.920
Jonouchi...

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:32.480
Big brother...

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:37.980
No!  Shizuka shouldn't see Jonouchi acting like this!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:41.410
No, Shizuka!  Don't remove your bandages!

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:46.220
She can't see Jonouchi acting like this.

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:54.590
It'll be heartbreaking if the first thing she sees is her dear brother acting like this.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.510
Big brother...

00:20:56.970 --> 00:21:00.600
Don't worry.  Trust your brother.

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:08.050
We have less than 4 minutes.

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:12.340
If nothing changes, we'll both sink to the bottom of the sea.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:15.510
My turn.  I draw!

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:18.900
Meteor of Destruction.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:22.950
That's a good card, Jonouchi.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:25.890
Use that card to finish him!

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:28.420
Aren't you continuing the duel?

00:21:41.780 --> 00:21:48.110
Seeing that Jonouchi isn't obeying Marik, Yugi declares that Marik is the true loser.

00:21:48.110 --> 00:21:53.650
Angered, Marik takes over Jonouchi's body so that he can finish Yugi himself.

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:58.170
Yugi is nearly defeated, but Jonouchi finally regains his senses.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:22:01.330
Then Yugi tries to save Jonouchi's life!

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:06.110
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Attack Me!
Last Turn of Destiny

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:07.600
Duel, standby!

00:22:21.700 --> 00:22:26.200
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:31.570
I feel like I've been here

00:22:32.100 --> 00:22:41.230
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:52.740
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:55.630 --> 00:23:00.240
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:00.930 --> 00:23:05.540
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:10.620
Will never change

00:23:11.310 --> 00:23:15.890
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:21.120
To be who I am

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:26.360
I've kept searching for something

00:23:27.020 --> 00:23:31.040
The time that we're now spending together

